{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"d73a9aecc7af9c46","type":"group","x":-500,"y":-980,"width":364,"height":295,"label":"S3ストレージ（Storage）の使用"},
		{"id":"8da9dfd3323c2d76","type":"group","ratio":1.7777777777777777,"x":-540,"y":-1840,"width":400,"height":225,"label":"CloudFront経由でWebサイト（Website）を公開"},
		{"id":"browser","type":"text","text":"## ブラウザ（Browser） / React\n\nリクエスト（Request）を送信する\nJSONを受け取り、機器一覧を表示する","x":400,"y":0,"width":440,"height":150},
		{"id":"api_request","type":"text","text":"## API Gateway\n\n機器一覧を取得するリクエスト（Request）を受け取る","x":1000,"y":220,"width":380,"height":120},
		{"id":"compute_request","type":"text","text":"## Lambda / Node.js\n\n機器一覧を取得する","x":1000,"y":500,"width":380,"height":120},
		{"id":"database","type":"text","text":"## DynamoDB\n\n検索結果を返す","x":400,"y":740,"width":440,"height":120},
		{"id":"compute_response","type":"text","text":"## Lambda / Node.js\n\nJSONレスポンス（JSON Response）を生成する","x":-160,"y":500,"width":380,"height":120},
		{"id":"api_response","type":"text","text":"## API Gateway\n\nJSONレスポンス（JSON Response）を返す","x":-160,"y":220,"width":380,"height":120},
		{
			"id":"2d49f63ef6bcdd61",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"![[Pasted image 20261007132942.png]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":312,
			"y":-2310,
			"width":593,
			"height":220
		},
		{
			"id":"8b6410a5a0b755b2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"トップページ（Top page）へのアクセス（Access）を設定する（CloudFront内）",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-448,
			"y":-1821,
			"width":283,
			"height":103
		},
		{
			"id":"1ed82977deed9244",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"「Default root object（任意）」に入力する",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-102,
			"y":-1800,
			"width":415,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"a67c7e7dbee25472","type":"text","text":"CloudFrontとは？","x":-94,"y":-1695,"width":250,"height":60},
		{
			"id":"51abf3b5e1cd57d4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"*** オリジン（Origin）",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":295,
			"y":-1505,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"bbd2025fff82f08c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"オリジン（Origin）の種類",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-94,
			"y":-1565,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"abf666786e30b9f5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"オリジン（Origin）",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-94,
			"y":-1505,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"95fd96929e84a1f8","type":"text","text":"CloudFrontのDistributionを作成する","x":-448,"y":-1695,"width":283,"height":60},
		{
			"id":"5e4c9a663f2098ae",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"タグ（Tag）とは？",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-94,
			"y":-1625,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"34d0d37edb1274e7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"CloudFrontの公開URLに再度アクセス（Access）する\n\nCloudFrontがS3から内容を再取得し、キャッシュ（Cache）に保存する",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-98,
			"y":-2800,
			"width":290,
			"height":190
		},
		{
			"id":"2f336b53f557e03d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"CloudFrontのInvalidationを作成する\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-98,
			"y":-2415,
			"width":290,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"6c3284e569765081",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"フロントエンド（Frontend）のコード（Code）を変更し、S3に反映する\n（コマンドライン（Command line）から更新）",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-448,
			"y":-2355,
			"width":283,
			"height":165
		},
		{
			"id":"30f082efa4d90a59",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"CloudFront経由で公開した内容に更新が反映されていないことに気づく",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-83,
			"y":-2230,
			"width":260,
			"height":110
		},
		{
			"id":"4ec035eda2f71cfd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"ローカル（Local）のVS CodeでAWS CLIを使えるようにする",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-458,
			"y":-2040,
			"width":302,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"64f882cd8867ab28",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- Macに**AWS CLIをインストール（Install）済み**  \n- **CLI用のAWS認証設定が完了**\n- **S3バケット（Bucket）へのアクセス（Access）権限がある**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-103,
			"y":-2040,
			"width":620,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"df49d9401141ad38",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"フロントエンド（Frontend）のプロジェクト（Project）のターミナル（Terminal）で、次のコマンド（Command）を実行する\n```\naws cloudfront create-invalidation \\\n  --distribution-id YOUR_DISTRIBUTION_ID \\\n  --paths \"/*\" \\\n  --profile aws-learning \\\n  --no-cli-pager\n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":572,
			"y":-2705,
			"width":380,
			"height":350
		},
		{
			"id":"05695307501899c7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"CLIの実行結果：\n{\n    \"Location\": \"https://cloudfront.amazonaws.com/2020-05-31/distribution/E1JYIKKU2FABXH/invalidation/I7FW4JVDPUV8FHSJMK51YM77K0\",\n    \"Invalidation\": {\n        \"Id\": \"I7FW4JVDPUV8FHSJMK51YM77K0\",\n        \"Status\": \"InProgress\",\n        \"CreateTime\": \"2026-10-07T04:38:32.735000+00:00\",\n        \"InvalidationBatch\": {\n            \"Paths\": {\n                \"Quantity\": 1,\n                \"Items\": [\n                    \"/*\"\n                ]\n            },\n            \"CallerReference\": \"cli-1791347911-59464\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1060,
			"y":-2665,
			"width":1120,
			"height":530
		},
		{
			"id":"979a5369ea113593",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"注意：ローカル環境（Local environment）で別のAWSアカウント（Account）にログイン（Login）していた場合は、アカウント（Account）を切り替える。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":612,
			"y":-2040,
			"width":473,
			"height":100
		},
		{"id":"fb17d0bff6474e48","type":"file","file":"日语/CloudFront 理解図解.md","x":1085,"y":-1865,"width":2855,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"3330dfbe1053ea3c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"CloudFrontから非公開のS3バケット（Bucket）へのアクセス（Access）を許可する",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":295,
			"y":-1345,
			"width":460,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"8283be9af8ca4c6b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Origin settings：CloudFrontが指定したオリジン（Origin）に接続する方法を設定する。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":295,
			"y":-1285,
			"width":740,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"b8a5187e5e22163c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"CloudFrontがS3 Bucket policyを更新し、S3バケット（Bucket）へのアクセス（Access）を許可する。このPolicyは、そのS3 Originを含むCloudFront Distributionの代理として送信されるリクエスト（Request）に限って、バケット（Bucket）へのアクセス（Access）を許可する。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":900,
			"y":-1385,
			"width":940,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"a73e52ba77e59eb2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"オリジンパス（Origin path、任意）",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":295,
			"y":-1445,
			"width":345,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"10ac939218693316",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"設定",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-94,
			"y":-1345,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"90cb45cf38f5c62a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"AWSのデータベース（Database）を使う",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-437,
			"y":-3080,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"9b63cb2eb5ac23bd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"AWSの\n　データベース",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"bracket-left","textAlign":"left"},
			"x":-580,
			"y":-3370,
			"width":60,
			"height":370
		},
		{
			"id":"71a51e999f22a1ab",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"React → API Gateway → Lambda → データを返す → React で表示",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-140,
			"y":-3280,
			"width":660,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"b776ec85636d705e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Cache settings：CloudFrontがキャッシュ（Cache）内の内容を返す場合と、オリジン（Origin）から新しい内容を取得する場合を決める。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":295,
			"y":-1228,
			"width":1050,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c13f994000c0cd26",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Webアプリケーション　ファイアウォール\n（Web Application Firewall、WAF）",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":295,
			"y":-1160,
			"width":565,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"c566fccb7e8c3f28",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"セキュリティ（Security）を有効にする",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-94,
			"y":-1160,
			"width":260,
			"height":80
		},
		{"id":"620ee06d6b744158","type":"text","text":"S3へアップロード（Upload）する","x":-437,"y":-950,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c8bf5f11d482f767","type":"text","text":"S3バケット（Bucket）を作成する","x":-437,"y":-783,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"862f8af85f4cd4f5","type":"text","text":"Block Public Accessの設定 - - - いつ、どう使う？","x":-98,"y":-780,"width":295,"height":57},
		{"id":"a4e16129b72cfd46","type":"text","text":"タグ（Tag） - - - 実際のプロジェクト（Project）ではどう使う？","x":-98,"y":-708,"width":518,"height":60},
		{"id":"1eed8fd05d2d1720","type":"text","text":"今は扱わない：デフォルトの暗号化（Default encryption）と詳細設定（Advanced settings）","x":-98,"y":-620,"width":731,"height":60},
		{"id":"5e12df435ec45f0e","type":"text","text":"プロジェクト（Project）を作成する","x":-437,"y":-590,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ff1a72989121603e","type":"text","text":"## ブラウザ（Browser） / React","x":-492,"y":-440,"width":360,"height":60}
	],
